#, no-wrap
msgid "Surface-code surgery: [Horsman et al., 2012](https://arxiv.org/abs/1111.4022).\n"
msgstr "Surface-Code-Surgery: [Horsman et al., 2012](https://arxiv.org/abs/1111.4022).\n"

